              "urpx:name": "Applies to low-income-eligible customers with NBT interconnection in calendar year 2025. 2025 vintage Low-Income value is $0.05400/kWh (Sheet 11 Table \u2014 4x the standard Residential adder). Low-income definition per Sheet 5: (a) enrolled in CARE or FERA, OR (b) resident-owner of a single-family home in a disadvantaged community per D.18-06-027, OR (c) resident of California Indian Country per D.20-12-003. The Low-Income-NBT-Eligible predicate is consumer-side-evaluable.",
